<h2>A note on these stories</h2>
<p>
    The stories on this site are restored full editions — rebuilt from the plots,
    character details, and jokes that were preserved from the originals. They are not
    word-for-word transcripts of the original posts, since the full original text
    wasn't available to work from for every story. Nothing has been invented to fill a
    gap; where a detail wasn't confirmed, it's left that way rather than guessed at.
</p>

<h2>A note on the artwork</h2>
<p>
    Every illustration here is either an original piece created for the Estate or a
    generated stand-in used only where a real illustration doesn't exist yet — those
    are clearly a different style and are logged in the project's own records so they
    can be swapped out the moment the real artwork is found.
</p>
